0..70 Comment "// Vector programs as they should read, and what refuses each of them."
71..73 Comment "//"
74..153 Comment "// A case on a vector binds each arm\'s index equation, prunes an arm whose ends"
154..232 Comment "// are apart, and solves an equation with a variable side. An equation between"
233..312 Comment "// two applications of one constructor splits into one equation for each field."
313..393 Comment "// A binder of a recursion\'s stage moves along its equation and keeps its stage."
394..455 Comment "// The model source `injective-index` holds `tail` and `zip`."
456..458 Comment "//"
459..530 Comment "// The checker refuses each declaration below by the name its attribute"
531..609 Comment "// states. Each turns to `checks` as its rung lands, and the source then moves"
610..631 Comment "// to the model root."
632..634 Comment "//"
635..692 Comment "// - owes: #3516 — an implicit under a constructor, for"
693..711 Comment "//   `firstOfPair`"
712..774 Comment "// - owes: #3517 — an implicit block on `def rec`, for `zip`"
775..830 Comment "// - see: #3481 — the spike that wrote these programs"
832..869 Comment "// The naturals the lengths count in."
